diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -3,6 +3,10 @@
 All notable changes to memleaf are documented here.
 
 ## Unreleased
+
+- Fix native-file observation on Windows by comparing ctime within path and handle observations, while preserving cross-observation identity/size/mtime checks. Normalize the CRLF test fixture before converting line endings; do not skip Windows checks.
+
+- Narrow explicit business-body compaction to one existing record per replacement. Copy the complete protected snapshot; do not default completed tasks to active or erase deadlines. Accept unchanged legacy echoes, reject identity merges and protected-field drift, and retain version-1 rollback recovery.
 
 - Gate future releases on native installed-artifact contract checks: build once, bind wheel/sdist and test inventory, then verify independent installations on Ubuntu/Python 3.11-3.13 and Windows/macOS Python 3.12. Include packaged Provider resources, real stdio/lock/restart checks and explicit failure on skipped or source-shadowed tests. This is deterministic validation, not live-model or installed-Hermes acceptance; defaults, prompt and version stay unchanged.
 
